{"@context":"https://schema.org","@type":"Article","@id":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/poem.html?id=open_03155","headline":"与弟游家园 · 张九龄","name":"与弟游家园","inLanguage":"zh-Hans","text":"定省荣君赐，来归是昼游。\n林乌飞旧里，园果让新秋。\n枝长南庭树，池临北涧流。\n星霜屡尔别，兰麝爲谁幽。\n善积家方庆，恩深国未酬。\n栖栖将义动，安得久情留。","author":{"@type":"Person","name":"张九龄","nationality":"唐"},"publisher":{"@type":"Organization","name":"石湖诗社","url":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/"},"image":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/og/open_03155.png","mainEntityOfPage":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/poem.html?id=open_03155","isPartOf":{"@type":"WebSite","name":"石湖诗社","url":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/"},"genre":"五言古诗","abstract":"收录于https://github.com/chinese-poetry/chinese-poetry"}